      <note>ECRMDP master ETL - one click full reload.
Row 1: clear the star schema, then load the 10 bronze staging tables.
Row 2: build dim_date and the 4 other dimensions.
Row 3: load the 8 fact tables, then run post-load checks (fails the job if any table is empty or a required key is missing).
Every arrow is 'on success': the job stops at the first failed step.</note>
